          "kind": "text",
          "text": "- **A lingering cough** (lasting weeks to months)\n- **Phlegm,** sometimes streaked with blood\n- **A persistent low-grade fever**\n- **Fatigue** and tiring easily\n- Night sweats, loss of appetite, weight loss"
